---
import BaseHead from '../../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import FooterScripts from '../../../components/FooterScripts.astro';
import SrkrHeader from '../../../components/SrkrHeader.astro';
import SrkrFooter from '../../../components/SrkrFooter.astro';
import OffCanvas from '../../../components/OffCanvas.astro';
import DeptNav from '../../../components/DeptNav.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="Department of Computer Science & Engineering | SRKR Engineering College" description="Department of Computer Science & Engineering at SRKR Engineering College, Bhimavaram — established 1991, NBA accredited, JNTUK Research Centre." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <SrkrHeader />

    <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
    <section class="rts-breadcrumb breadcrumb-height breadcumb-bg" style="background-image: url(/assets/images/faculty/cse/csehome.jpeg);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="breadcrumb-content">
              <ul class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/departments">Departments</a></li>
              </ul>
              <h1 class="section-title">Department of Computer Science & Engineering</h1>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- BREADCRUMB AREA END -->

    <!-- content -->
    <div class="rts-faculty-details py-5">
      <div class="container">

        <DeptNav dept="cse" current="Home" />

        <!-- About the Department -->
        <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-md-center mb-5 pb-5">
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="faculty-content-text me-5">
              <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-5">About the Department</h3>

              
              <p style="text-align: justify;">Established in 1991, the Department of Computer Science and Engineering has grown from an initial intake of 40 students into a premier academic and research hub with a current B.Tech (CSE) intake of 300. Recognized as a Research Centre by JNTU Kakinada since 2019, the department also offers an M.Tech program in Computer Science and Technology. Supported by experienced faculty, specialized laboratories, E-classrooms, and ICT-enabled infrastructure, the department provides a dynamic and student-centric learning environment.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">The curriculum is aligned with global technological trends and AICTE guidelines, offering specializations in AI/ML and IoT, along with Honors and Minor programs. Strong industry collaborations with organizations such as TCS iON, Netenrich, and Bennett University enhance practical exposure and employability. The department consistently achieves excellent placement records with top salary packages. Professional bodies like ISTE and the Association of Computer Engineers (ACE) further promote technical, co-curricular, and leadership excellence among students.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zWHp1cRW8fc?html5=1&enablejsapi=1"
                title="SRKR Department Video"
                loading="lazy"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Message from HoD -->
        <div class="row mt--30">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Message from Head of Department</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-8">
            <div class="faculty-image text-center">
              {/* TODO: replace with real faculty photo */}
              <img class="img-fluid mw-100" src="/assets/images/faculty/cse/222-m.jpeg" alt="Dr. Bh. V. S. Rama Krishnam Raju">
              <div class="h5 mb-2 mt-5">Dr. Bh. V. S. Rama Krishnam Raju</div>
              <span>Professor &amp; Head of Department</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="faculty-content-text ms-lg-5 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Welcome to the Department of Computer Science &amp; Engineering</p>
              
              <p style="text-align: justify;">Since its inception in 1991, the CSE Department at SRKR Engineering College has evolved into a premier destination for computer science education. We are committed to providing a high-quality, vibrant learning environment backed by state-of-the-art laboratories and smart classrooms. Our curriculum builds strong foundations in core computing while offering robust exposure to emerging technologies like AI, Machine Learning, Cyber Security, and Cloud Computing. Recognized as a Research Centre by JNTU Kakinada, the department offers M.Tech and doctoral programs, actively driving innovation through industry partnerships, hackathons, and project-based learning. Nurtured by student professional bodies, our graduates excel in global placements, emerging as competent, ethical, and socially responsible engineers. I invite you to join us on this journey of learning, innovation, and excellence.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-top my-60 my_sm--10"></div>

          <!-- Mission & Vision -->
          <div class="row g-4 align-items-start justify-content-md-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 rts-scholarship-description">
              <div class="faculty-content-text si__list h-100">
                <h4 class="font-32 mb-3 mt-4">Vision</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list mb-0">
                  <li class="mb-3">To envision a diverse, stimulating, continually improving academic and research environment to fulfill the needs of the society and to mould students as socially responsible and competent professionals in the field of computer science and engineering.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 rts-scholarship-description">
              <div class="faculty-content-text si__list h-100">
                <h4 class="font-32 mb-4">Mission</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list">
                  <li class="mb-3">To provide a strong theoretical and practical background across the computer science and engineering discipline with an emphasis on software development.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To impart modern technologies with industrial, academic and research collaboration.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To inculcate professional behaviour, strong ethical values, leadership abilities and impart the skills necessary to continue education for professional growth.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Specializations -->
        <div class="row g-5 faculty-sub-details rts-section-padding pt_sm--40">
          <div class="rts-section mb-4 text-center">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Core Specializations</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/placeholder/photo-1677442136019-21780ecad995_600x380.jpg" alt="Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/">Artificial Intelligence &amp; ML</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/placeholder/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31_600x380.jpg" alt="Internet of Things" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/">Internet of Things</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/placeholder/photo-1614064641938-3bbee52942c7_600x380.jpg" alt="Cyber Security" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/">Cyber Security</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6">
            <div class="single-cat-item civil-spec-card">
              <div class="cat-thumb civil-spec-thumb">
                <img src="/assets/images/placeholder/photo-1544197150-b99a580bb7a8_600x380.jpg" alt="Cloud Computing" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <div class="cat-meta">
                <div class="cat-title">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/">Cloud Computing</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cat-link">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/" class="cat-link-arrow"><i class="fa-sharp fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Academics & Programs -->
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center g-0">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60 text-center pt_sm--40">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Academics &amp; Programs</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Undergraduate</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/academic-programs/" class="link__list">B.Tech Computer Science &amp; Engg
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/academic-programs/" class="link__list">4-Year JNTUK Affiliated
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/academic-programs/" class="link__list">NBA Accredited
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/academic-programs/" class="link__list">AI/ML &amp; IoT Specializations
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item v__2">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Postgraduate</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/academic-programs/" class="link__list">M.Tech Computer Science &amp; Technology
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/academic-programs/" class="link__list">2-Year JNTUK Affiliated (Since 2006)
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/academic-programs/" class="link__list">Honors &amp; Minors Tracks
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/academic-programs/" class="link__list">Research &amp; Thesis Project
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-10">
            <div class="program__single--item">
              <div class="program__single--item--bg">
                <img src="/assets/images/program/program__bg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </div>
              <h5 class="program__single--item--title">Research</h5>
              <ul class="program__single--item--list">
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">Ph.D. Programs (JNTUK)
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">JNTUK Research Centre (Since 2019)
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">Industry Collaborations
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li class="program__single--item--list--item">
                  <a href="/departments/cse/research-consultancy/" class="link__list">100+ SCI/Scopus Publications
                    <span><i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-right"></i></span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- content end -->

    <!-- Department Highlights -->
    <div class="rts-blog v_1 rts__light rts-section-padding">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center">
          <div class="col-md-11 col-lg-12">
            <div class="rts-section rts-border-bottom-1 mb--50 pb--20">
              <h2 class="rts-section-title text-uppercase">Department Highlights</h2>
              <p class="rts-section-description">Three decades of excellence in computer science education, research, and placements.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center">
          <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-11">
            <div class="card shadow-sm p-4" style="border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee; background: #fff;">
              <div class="card-body">
                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;">
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering is one of the oldest and most prestigious departments of SRKR Engineering College, established in 1991, and has grown from an intake of 40 students to 300 students annually.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The B.Tech. Computer Science and Engineering programme is accredited by the National Board of Accreditation (NBA), reflecting its commitment to academic excellence and continuous improvement.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The Department is recognized as a Research Centre by Jawaharlal Nehru Technological University Kakinada (JNTUK), supporting doctoral research and advanced studies in emerging areas of computing.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The Department regularly organizes the International Conference on Advances in Artificial Intelligence (ICAAAI), providing a global platform for researchers, academicians, industry experts, and students to present their innovations and research contributions.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The Department offers industry-oriented education through specialized domains such as Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Data Science, Cyber Security, Cloud Computing, Full Stack Development, and Generative AI.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>Students actively participate in national and international hackathons, coding competitions, internships, innovation challenges, and startup initiatives, fostering technical excellence and entrepreneurial skills.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The Department has a strong research ecosystem with significant contributions in the form of Scopus-indexed publications, patents, book chapters, and collaborations with academic and industry partners.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-0 d-flex align-items-start">
                    <span class="text-primary me-3" style="font-size: 18px;"><i class="fa-sharp fa-light fa-circle-check"></i></span>
                    <span>The Department provides state-of-the-art computing laboratories, modern classrooms, high-speed internet facilities, and access to advanced software tools to support quality teaching, learning, and research.</span>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Department Highlights end -->

    <SrkrFooter />
    <OffCanvas />
    <FooterScripts />

    <style>
      /* Equal-height specialization cards */
      .civil-spec-card {
        height: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .civil-spec-thumb {
        height: 220px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .civil-spec-thumb img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
